   "text": "Relationships  →  build-before edges  →  indegree  →  Kahn / DFS  →  layers  →  exact file order (works for any LLD problem)",
   "originalText": "Relationships  →  build-before edges  →  indegree  →  Kahn / DFS  →  layers  →  exact file order (works for any LLD problem)",
