   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1795464289639,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Which relationship creates which build edge",
   "originalText": "1. Which relationship creates which build edge",
   "fontSize": 30,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el4_160816",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 26,
   "y": 214,
   "width": 1324.8,
   "height": 200.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1953574603,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1089709947,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1795464289639,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "UML arrow                   Example                              Graph edge (build first → then)      Hard edge?\nInheritance    ───▷        Dog ───▷ Animal                      Animal → Dog                         always (base class must be complete)\nRealization    ┈┈┈▷        Circle ┈┈┈▷ «interface» Shape         Shape → Circle                       always\nComposition    ◆───        House ◆─── Room                      Room → House                         always (stored by value, size needed)\n  (strong has-a / strict composition / part-of)\nAggregation    ◇───        Team ◇─── Player                     Player → Team                        only if the header calls its methods\n  (weak has-a)\nAssociation    ───>        Driver ───> Car                      Car → Driver                         only if the header calls its methods\n  (simple, knows-a)\nDependency     ┈┈┈>        Printer ┈┈┈> Document                Document → Printer                   if it calls methods or does new X",
   "originalText": "UML arrow                   Example                              Graph edge (build first → then)      Hard edge?\nInheritance    ───▷        Dog ───▷ Animal                      Animal → Dog                         always (base class must be complete)\nRealization    ┈┈┈▷        Circle ┈┈┈▷ «interface» Shape         Shape → Circle                       always\nComposition    ◆───        House ◆─── Room                      Room → House                         always (stored by value, size needed)\n  (strong has-a / strict composition / part-of)\nAggregation    ◇───        Team ◇─── Player                     Player → Team                        only if the header calls its methods\n  (weak has-a)\nAssociation    ───>        Driver ───> Car                      Car → Driver                         only if the header calls its methods\n  (simple, knows-a)\nDependency     ┈┈┈>        Printer ┈┈┈> Document                Document → Printer                   if it calls methods or does new X",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el5_325127",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 26,
   "y": 438.0,
   "width": 1184.56,
   "height": 21.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 80521325,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 184570286,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1795464289639,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Strong vs weak association:  strict composition (◆) = strong has-a,  aggregation (◇) = weak has-a,  simple association (──>) = knows-a",
   "originalText": "Strong vs weak association:  strict composition (◆) = strong has-a,  aggregation (◇) = weak has-a,  simple association (──>) = knows-a",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
