  },
  {
   "id": "el113_337753",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1002.6666666666666,
   "y": 2200.3,
   "width": 556.8,
   "height": 37.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 429320601,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1111620701,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1795464289639,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "7. Algorithm B: DFS (post-order)",
   "originalText": "7. Algorithm B: DFS (post-order)",
   "fontSize": 30,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el114_616719",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1002.6666666666666,
   "y": 2256.3,
   "width": 489.59999999999997,
   "height": 380.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 763564744,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1569819131,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1795464289639,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "DFS  \"start from main, keep asking what it needs\"\n\nvisit(X):\n    if state[X] == DONE:     return\n    if state[X] == VISITING: CYCLE FOUND\n    state[X] = VISITING\n    for each P that X needs:      # its #includes\n        visit(P)\n    state[X] = DONE\n    order.append(X)               # post-order\n\nvisit(main); then visit any class not reached\n\norder = leaves first, main last.\nKahn gives 'waves' (all basic units together);\nDFS is how you think top-down: to write the Facade\nI need the Manager, to write the Manager I need the\nAbstractBase, to write that I need the models ...\nBoth give a valid order. The order is not unique.",
   "originalText": "DFS  \"start from main, keep asking what it needs\"\n\nvisit(X):\n    if state[X] == DONE:     return\n    if state[X] == VISITING: CYCLE FOUND\n    state[X] = VISITING\n    for each P that X needs:      # its #includes\n        visit(P)\n    state[X] = DONE\n    order.append(X)               # post-order\n\nvisit(main); then visit any class not reached\n\norder = leaves first, main last.\nKahn gives 'waves' (all basic units together);\nDFS is how you think top-down: to write the Facade\nI need the Manager, to write the Manager I need the\nAbstractBase, to write that I need the models ...\nBoth give a valid order. The order is not unique.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el115_130387",
