   "text": "9. Kahn's algorithm run on the generic graph, step by step",
   "originalText": "9. Kahn's algorithm run on the generic graph, step by step",
   "fontSize": 30,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el120_858254",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 26,
   "y": 2776.3,
   "width": 1377.0,
   "height": 300.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2121795575,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 750587752,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1795464289639,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Step  Write this (pop)    Indegree drops                                Became 0 → enqueue              Queue after\n  1   Utils               ConcreteFactory 3→2                           -                               Enum, Interface, LeafModel\n  2   Enum                AbstractBase 3→2                              -                               Interface, LeafModel\n  3   Interface           ConcreteStrategy 1→0, AbstractBase 2→1        ConcreteStrategy                LeafModel, ConcreteStrategy\n  4   LeafModel           CompositeModel 1→0                            CompositeModel                  ConcreteStrategy, CompositeModel\n  5   ConcreteStrategy    main 2→1                                      -                               CompositeModel\n  6   CompositeModel      AbstractBase 1→0, Facade 4→3                  AbstractBase                    AbstractBase\n  7   AbstractBase        ConcreteChild 1→0, Service 1→0,               ConcreteChild, Service,         ConcreteChild, Service, FactoryInterface, Manager\n                          FactoryInterface 1→0, Manager 1→0             FactoryInterface, Manager\n  8   ConcreteChild       ConcreteFactory 2→1                           -                               Service, FactoryInterface, Manager\n  9   Service             Facade 3→2                                    -                               FactoryInterface, Manager\n 10   FactoryInterface    ConcreteFactory 1→0                           ConcreteFactory                 Manager, ConcreteFactory\n 11   Manager             Facade 2→1                                    -                               ConcreteFactory\n 12   ConcreteFactory     Facade 1→0                                    Facade                          Facade\n 13   Facade              main 1→0                                      main                            main\n 14   main                -                                             -                               [ ]",
   "originalText": "Step  Write this (pop)    Indegree drops                                Became 0 → enqueue              Queue after\n  1   Utils               ConcreteFactory 3→2                           -                               Enum, Interface, LeafModel\n  2   Enum                AbstractBase 3→2                              -                               Interface, LeafModel\n  3   Interface           ConcreteStrategy 1→0, AbstractBase 2→1        ConcreteStrategy                LeafModel, ConcreteStrategy\n  4   LeafModel           CompositeModel 1→0                            CompositeModel                  ConcreteStrategy, CompositeModel\n  5   ConcreteStrategy    main 2→1                                      -                               CompositeModel\n  6   CompositeModel      AbstractBase 1→0, Facade 4→3                  AbstractBase                    AbstractBase\n  7   AbstractBase        ConcreteChild 1→0, Service 1→0,               ConcreteChild, Service,         ConcreteChild, Service, FactoryInterface, Manager\n                          FactoryInterface 1→0, Manager 1→0             FactoryInterface, Manager\n  8   ConcreteChild       ConcreteFactory 2→1                           -                               Service, FactoryInterface, Manager\n  9   Service             Facade 3→2                                    -                               FactoryInterface, Manager\n 10   FactoryInterface    ConcreteFactory 1→0                           ConcreteFactory                 Manager, ConcreteFactory\n 11   Manager             Facade 2→1                                    -                               ConcreteFactory\n 12   ConcreteFactory     Facade 1→0                                    Facade                          Facade\n 13   Facade              main 1→0                                      main                            main\n 14   main                -                                             -                               [ ]",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el121_482348",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 26,
   "y": 3092.3,
   "width": 1747.2,
   "height": 20.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#2b8a3e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
