   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "12. File order (Kahn result) + what to test",
   "originalText": "12. File order (Kahn result) + what to test",
   "fontSize": 30,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el175_896910",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 26,
   "y": 4148.3,
   "width": 806.4,
   "height": 280.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1919876317,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1959553144,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1795464289639,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": " 1. utils/Utils.h                  in=0  call each helper, print the result\n 2. enums/Enum.h                   in=0  print a value through a toString() helper\n 3. strategies/Interface.h         in=0  interface only: just make sure it compiles\n 4. models/LeafModel.h             in=0  create one, print its fields\n 5. strategies/ConcreteStrategy.h  in=1  call its method, print a line\n 6. models/CompositeModel.h        in=1  add a few leaf models, print list / total\n 7. models/AbstractBase.h          in=3  abstract: compiles, cannot be instantiated\n 8. models/ConcreteChild.h         in=1  create via a base pointer, call getType()\n 9. services/Service.h             in=1  pass an object in, see the side effect\n10. factories/FactoryInterface.h   in=1  interface only: just make sure it compiles\n11. managers/Manager.h             in=1  add, find by id, list all\n12. factories/ConcreteFactory.h    in=3  returns the right subclass for each type\n13. <App>.h                        in=4  each public method works for one happy path\n14. main.cpp                       in=2  one full end-to-end flow",
   "originalText": " 1. utils/Utils.h                  in=0  call each helper, print the result\n 2. enums/Enum.h                   in=0  print a value through a toString() helper\n 3. strategies/Interface.h         in=0  interface only: just make sure it compiles\n 4. models/LeafModel.h             in=0  create one, print its fields\n 5. strategies/ConcreteStrategy.h  in=1  call its method, print a line\n 6. models/CompositeModel.h        in=1  add a few leaf models, print list / total\n 7. models/AbstractBase.h          in=3  abstract: compiles, cannot be instantiated\n 8. models/ConcreteChild.h         in=1  create via a base pointer, call getType()\n 9. services/Service.h             in=1  pass an object in, see the side effect\n10. factories/FactoryInterface.h   in=1  interface only: just make sure it compiles\n11. managers/Manager.h             in=1  add, find by id, list all\n12. factories/ConcreteFactory.h    in=3  returns the right subclass for each type\n13. <App>.h                        in=4  each public method works for one happy path\n14. main.cpp                       in=2  one full end-to-end flow",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el176_166447",
